            <ArticleTitle>[The use of tramal in the orthopedics-traumatology clinic].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>49-52</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>There were performed clinical and biochemical investigations of nonnarcotic analgetic tramal application (FRG, Grunenthal) with 196 patients of orthopedic-traumatologic type. The conclusion was drawn that the most effective is tramal application in patients with chronic pains in case of purulent complications and the optimum combination is the coupling of tramal with baralgin and relanium.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
